description:
**Job Description**
* Monitor price competitiveness: maintain tracker and monitor price competitiveness closely; work closely with Business Intelligence (BI) to make necessary data \& tracker adjustments;
* Collaborate cross\-functionally: work with business development (BD), BI, and Product teams to execute pricing actions;
* Assist in driving seller adoption and engagement for pricing\-related tools \& features via data analysis and solution development \& execution;
* Analyze \& improve performance via data\-driven analysis to refine pricing strategies and enhance seller engagement;
* Manage E2E workflow with 3rd party vendors, including contract management, paperwork handling, and resolution of ad\-hoc operational issues, while managing workload distribution and daily operations for a large team of third\-party staff performing business development administrative tasks related to pricing;
* Work closely with Local and Regional Product to roll out new features in Vietnam and provide feedback loops to Regional teams for seamless seller/user experience;
* Identify seller needs \& feature enhancement opportunity and discuss with Product regarding feature development/improvement;
* Other tasks as assigned.


**Requirements**
* Fresh graduates or candidates with less than one year of relevant experience;
* Analytical and data\-driven approach to problem solving; comfortable with numbers and conducting analyses;
* Passion for creating highly usable and thorough dashboards/visualizations;
* Strong analytical thinking and ability to learn quickly with can do attitude;
* Advanced Excel skills with knowledge in Power Query, Power Pivots;
* Critical thinking, multitasking \& creative thinking;
* Strong verbal and written communication skills in both English and Vietnamese to coordinate with stakeholders;
* Good team player, positive attitude, and eager to learn.


**Please note that only shortlisted candidates will be contacted for the next steps within three weeks.**

**JOB DESCRIPTION** 




 You will be responsible for building and deploying Machine Learning models focused on customer retention prediction and personalized product recommendation for Hasaki’s eCommerce platform. This role has a direct impact on reducing churn, increasing customer lifetime value (LTV), and enhancing the overall shopping experience.










**KEY RESPONSIBILITIES** 



* Develop churn prediction models and identify high\-risk customer segments.
* Build personalized product recommendation systems based on user behavior, purchase history, and contextual signals.
* Collaborate with CDP \& Marketing teams to design retention campaigns powered by predictive insights.
* Design and run A/B tests to evaluate model effectiveness (retention uplift, CTR, conversion rate).
* Ensure models deliver measurable business value (e.g., churn reduction, LTV growth, repeat purchase uplift).
* Work closely with Product, BI, and CDP teams to translate insights into actionable strategies.









**REQUIREMENTS** 



* **3 \- 5 years of experience in Data Science,** 
 eCommerce or CDP experience is preferred;
* **Proficiency in Python** 
 (Pandas, scikit\-learn; TensorFlow/ PyTorch is a plus);
* Strong knowledge of: Customer retention modeling and churn prediction, Recommendation systems (Collaborative Filtering, Content\-based, Hybrid), Clustering, segmentation, and uplift modeling;
* Hands\-on experience deploying models into production and monitoring real\-world performance;
* Strong analytical and statistical skills, including A/B test design and evaluation;









**BENEFITS** 



* Salary range: Open to negotiate;
* 13th\-month salary, annual salary review;
* Insurance will be paid according to company policy;
* Working devices provided, parking fee allowance (if any);









**WORKING PLACE:** 
 568 Luy Ban Bich St., Tan Phu Ward, Ho Chi Minh City










 If you need any further information, contact me via
 **Telegram (callmeEvelynnn)** 
 or shoot me your CV at
 **thuyntt9@hasaki.vn** 
 to apply.










***\*\*\*Please note that only shortlisted candidates will be contacted. Thanks for your concern. ^^***
